# SEOdaily-ENG

English version of Seoul Economic Daily - Korean business news translated to English.

**Last Updated**: 2025-12-21 (Phase 27: SSR Migration & SEO Optimization)

## Overview

SEOdaily-ENG is the official English version of Seoul Economic Daily's website. It provides **real-time translation** of Korean business and financial news using BigKinds API and Anthropic Claude Opus 4.5, with automatic updates every 1 hour.

**Live Demo**: https://en.sedaily.com

## Features

- ✅ **Real-time Updates**: Collects today's articles every hour
- ✅ **Client-Side Loading**: No frontend rebuild needed - users see latest articles on refresh
- ✅ **Automatic Translation**: Korean → English via Anthropic Claude Opus 4.5
- ✅ **Content Filtering**: Only articles with content are displayed
- ✅ **Search Functionality**: Title + content search with highlighting
- ✅ **7 Categories**: Finance, Technology, Politics, Society, Culture, Sports, International
- ✅ **SEO Optimized**: JSON-LD structured data, robots.txt, sitemap.xml
- ✅ **Responsive Design**: Desktop/Tablet/Mobile
- ✅ **Premium Dark Theme**: Washington Post/NYT inspired
- ✅ **Original Links**: Direct links to Seoul Economic articles (provider_link_page)
- ✅ **Smart Deduplication**: Prevents duplicate articles in DynamoDB
- ✅ **Seoul Economic Logo**: Clickable logo in header for easy access to main site
- ✅ **CMS Article Editor**: Edit articles via https://enadmin.sedaily.ai with direct DynamoDB updates

## Architecture

```
EventBridge (Every Hour)
  ↓
Lambda Collector (Collects today's articles)
  ↓
BigKinds API (Seoul Economic only)
  ↓
Anthropic Claude (Korean → English)
  ↓
DynamoDB (Deduplicated storage)
  ↓
API Gateway (Search + Article APIs)
  ↓
EC2 (Next.js SSR + CSR Hybrid)
  ↓
Users (SEO-optimized, real-time articles)
```

### SSR Architecture (Phase 27)
- **EC2 Instance**: t3.medium (2 vCPU, 4GB RAM)
- **Next.js SSR**: Server-Side Rendering for SEO optimization
- **Hybrid Rendering**: SSR for initial load + CSR for interactions
- **PM2**: Process manager for Node.js application
- **Nginx**: Reverse proxy with HTTPS (Let's Encrypt)
- **Domain**: en.sedaily.com (primary)

