## How Real-time Updates Work

### Automatic Collection (Every Hour at :48)
1. EventBridge triggers Lambda at :48 every hour
2. Collect **today's articles** (00:00 ~ 23:59) from BigKinds
3. Check DynamoDB - skip if article already exists (deduplication)
4. Filter out articles without content
5. Translate Korean → English via Anthropic Claude Opus 4.5
6. Save to DynamoDB with original Seoul Economic link

### Frontend Display (On Page Load)
1. User visits/refreshes page
2. Client-side API call to DynamoDB
3. Fetch latest articles (sorted by date)
4. Display newest as Featured
5. **No frontend rebuild needed**

### Article Rotation
- **Featured**: Always newest article (articles[0])
- **Top Stories**: 2nd-6th newest (articles[1-5])
- **Most Popular**: 7th-11th newest (articles[6-10])
- **Automatic**: Featured changes when new article added
- **Original Links**: Each article links to Seoul Economic (https://www.sedaily.com/NewsView/...)

